  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per every 1,000 points unless otherwise stated (p. 113). The builder applies them as written, which is right for armies up to 1,000 points; scale them up yourself for larger armies.",
    "The brigade box prices Line Infantry at 22 points; the stat table's 33 is used. The chapter (p. 47) gives the Foot battery Stamina 2 and the Vanguard Battalion no Marauder; the list's table is followed.",
    "Half batteries cost half points, rounded up (Foot 14, Horse 15), with the usual half battery stat line (2-1-1, Stamina 1).",
    "The Uhlan regiment was historically Small: take the Uhlan Squadron, or a Small Uhlan regiment, which is the same."
  ],
  "alliesRules": [
    {
      "maxPercent": 50,
