    }
  ],
  "upgradesModelled": true,
  "specialRules": [
    "All Brunswick infantry: Must Form Square, Mixed Formation, Column of Companies (see the British rules), and can form skirmish order in terrain they couldn't normally enter. Brunswick infantry can use Attack Column.",
    "Brunswick cavalry can form Line, Deep Formation (see the British rules) and March Column."
  ]
